## P2P - Prompt To Policy

### Quick Start

1. Create and install into a virtual environment (uv + venv):

```bash
./scripts/bootstrap_uv_venv.sh
source .venv/bin/activate
```

2. Run one-stage FR3 curriculum training:

```bash
prompt2policy train --experiment configs/experiment.yaml
```

### Alternative Setup (python venv + pip)

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -e ".[dev]"
```

### uv Commands

```bash
# Create venv and install project + dev extras
uv venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
uv pip install -e ".[dev]"

# Run without manual activation
uv run prompt2policy train --experiment configs/experiment.yaml
```

### CLI Commands

- `prompt2policy train --experiment <path>`
- `prompt2policy generate-stage --previous-task <path> --output <path> --mean-reward <value>`
- `prompt2policy evaluate --checkpoint <path> --robot-config <path> --task <path>`
